qode (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Web development: CSS colour swatches with a colour picker, Emmet for HTML and JSX, ESLint and Tailwind CSS companion servers.
  * Rename Symbol (F2) and Find References (Shift+F12); bookmarks moved to Shift+F2 / Ctrl+Shift+F2.
  * HTML, CSS and JSON formatting through their language servers; indentation follows the file.
  * Terminal: scrolling fixes, rounded themed tabs; welcome page no longer squeezes when short.
  * LSP server log is now a resizable, themed dialog with filter and copy.

 -- Zahid Khalilov <halilzahid@gmail.com>  Sun, 04 Oct 2026 20:50:00 +0200

